flowchart TD
    Dev[Developer push / pull request] --> GH[GitHub repository]
    GH --> CI[GitHub Actions]
    CI --> TF[Terraform format / init / validate]
    CI --> HL[Helm lint]
    GH --> IMG[Component image build workflows]
    IMG --> REG[Container image registry]
    TF --> K8S[Kubernetes cluster]
    HL --> CHART[Voting App Helm chart]
    CHART --> K8S
    REG --> K8S
    subgraph Voting App
      V[Vote UI] --> R[(Redis queue)]
      R --> W[Worker]
      W --> P[(PostgreSQL)]
      P --> RES[Results UI]
    end
    K8S --> V
    K8S --> W
    K8S --> RES
    subgraph Robot Shop / Observability
      RS[Robot Shop services] --> PR[Prometheus]
      PR --> GF[Grafana dashboard]
      RS --> FB[Fluent Bit]
      FB --> LK[(Loki logs)]
      RS --> OT[OpenTelemetry Collector]
      OT --> JA[Jaeger traces]
      PR --> AL[Alert / SLO]
      AL --> RB[Runbook]
    end
    K8S --> RS
